    "id": "incident-first",
    "question": "IR-4 的事件处理能力应覆盖哪些阶段？",
    "events": [
      {
        "type": "intent",
        "intent": "knowledge"
      },
      {
        "type": "contexts",
        "contexts": [
          {
            "source": "NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL",
            "page": null,
            "domain": "隔离开发资料",
            "text": "Incident Handling\n[ir-4_smt.a] Implement an incident handling capability for incidents that is consistent with the incid",
            "locator": "ir-4",
            "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/usnistgov/oscal-content/f0de6d8d8c059d374f15e0ae07508d82e370fc1d/nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json"
          },
          {
            "source": "NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL",
            "page": null,
            "domain": "实验补充资料",
            "text": "Literacy Training and Awareness\n[at-2_smt.a] Provide security and privacy literacy training to system users (including m",
            "locator": "at-2",
            "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/usnistgov/oscal-content/f0de6d8d8c059d374f15e0ae07508d82e370fc1d/nist.gov/SP800-53/rev5/json/NIST_SP-800-53_rev5_catalog.json"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "token",
        "content": "**IR-4 要求的事件处理能力覆盖五个阶段：准备（preparation）、检测与分析（detection and analysis）、遏制（containment）、根除（eradication）和恢复（recovery）。**\n\n依据 [ir-4_smt.a]，组织应为事件建立与事件响应计划一致的事件处理能力，且该能力须包含上述五个阶段。需要注意，这五个阶段是能力必须覆盖的内容，并非全部要求；IR-4 同时要求：\n\n- **与应急规划活动协调**：事件处理活动须与应急规划（contingency planning）活动协调 [ir-4_smt.b]；\n- **纳入经验教训**：将持续开展的事件处理活动中得到的经验教训纳入事件响应程序、培训和测试，并据此落实相应变更 [ir-4_smt.c]；\n- **全组织一致可比**：确保事件处理活动的严谨性、强度、范围和结果在整个组织内具有可比性和可预测性 [ir-4_smt.d]。\n\n**易混淆点**：不要把这五个阶段理解为“唯一要求”，也不要遗漏 b、c、d 三项配套动作；其中 c 项的“经验教训”要落到程序、培训和测试三类载体上，并实施由此产生的变更。\n\n【出处】[资料1]《NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL》定位【ir-4】"
      },
      {
